{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53822","headline":"听琵琶劝殷协律酒 · 白居易","name":"听琵琶劝殷协律酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何堪朔塞胡关曲，又是秋天雨夜闻。\n青塚葬时沙莽莽，乌孙愁处雪纷纷。\n知君怕病推辞酒，故遣琵琶劝谏君。\n（《白氏文集管见抄》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}